{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "15a42ff9-a4ec-8e63-bffd-ed52d232513e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T09:54:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan B. Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Beth. Hi, yes, my name is Alan Burdick. I'm calling about the winter basketball for the kids. The youth league. Do you still have sign-ups open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, we do, yes. Let me pull it up so I give you the right information. Is this for your child, or a grandchild?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My nephew. He's eleven, he lives with me and my sister right now, so I'm doing the calling because she works mornings. He's been bouncing that ball off my kitchen wall for a month, so I said okay, let's get him in a real gym."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet the neighbors are thrilled. Okay, so eleven. That'd put him in our upper elementary, middle school group. Let me see what's showing for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's good. Take your time. I'm just sitting here with my coffee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Alright, so registration is still open for that division. Do you want to do it over the phone, or would you rather come by and fill out the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, what's easier? I don't, I'm not so good with the computer. My cell is, the signal goes in and out a little, so if I drop, I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. If you drop, I'll just call you back. I can take the information over the phone, and then you'd just have to sign something when you come in, or at the first practice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay, good. And when does it start? What's the start date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the first practices are the week of the sixteenth. Let me double check that, hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Yes, the season gets going the week of the sixteenth with practices, and then games begin a couple of weeks after that. They'll give you the exact schedule once the teams are set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sixteenth, that's next Monday, then. Okay. [pause] Hold on one second, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Mana, e ta pergunta pa dia dezasseis. Si, si. Dja N ta djobi. Okay, sorry, that was my sister. She says is that a school day, can he get there after school?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no worries, tell her hi. Yes, practices are after school hours, so late afternoon into the evening. I can tell you the exact time once I see which team he lands on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good. She'll like that. She was worried about work, she gets out at four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That should work out fine. Let me get him signed up. What's his full name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "His name is Marcos Teixeira. M-A-R-C-O-S. Teixeira, T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Marcos Teixeira. And his birthday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "March ninth. Two thousand fourteen. So he's almost twelve, I guess. He keeps telling me that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They always round up. Hold on, that might change the division slightly. Let me look. Okay, he'd still be in the same group for this season. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. He'll be happy. He doesn't want to play with the little kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nobody does at that age. Okay, and a phone number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one. Great. And is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my cell. This one. So if the line [line breaks up] you can call right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out for a second there. You said call you back on the cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, this cell. It's fine. The signal is bad in my kitchen. Let me walk to the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Is that better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Better, yeah. Okay. So, is there anything he needs to bring? Sneakers, I know. Water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sneakers that are non-marking, so the gym floor stays nice, and a water bottle. We'll have team shirts for him. Nothing fancy otherwise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll write that down. Non-marking sneakers. He has the black ones, I hope those are okay, I'll check the bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the bottoms are black and they leave marks, that's the thing to watch for. If they're the gum kind, usually that's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gum kind. I'll have him show me. You know, Beth, you're very patient. I appreciate it. I make soap, you know, in small batches, just to give as gifts. If you want, I'll bring a bar by when I bring the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:52:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, how nice! You don't have to do that, but that's very sweet. What kind of soap?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oatmeal and honey, mostly. Some lavender in the winter. Nothing complicated, I just like making it. My sister says my house smells like a spa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:52:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds lovely. Well, I'll look forward to it. So, when you come in with the form, we're open regular weekday hours, and you can just ask for me or whoever's at the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can come this week. Maybe Thursday, after I drop my sister at her job."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday works. I'll have his registration started in the system, and then you'll just sign and we're done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And the cost, is there a fee? I should bring money?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a program fee, and I'll go over the details with you when you come in. If it's a hardship, we do have ways to work with families, so don't let that worry you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's okay, I just want to be ready. Okay. So, practices the week of the sixteenth, after school, I come Thursday to sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it exactly. And once the coach is assigned, someone will call you at that cell number with the team and the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:54:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Marcos is going to be so happy. Thank you, Beth. You have a good day, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:54:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Alan. Tell Marcos good luck, and we'll see you Thursday. Bye bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye, thank you."
    }
  ],
